  "controls": [
    "native debuglog authentic private assembly preserves original callable shapes and lazy initial state",
    "native debuglog rejects foreign require and missing actual bootstrap without publication",
    "native debuglog requires actual inspector and complete selected require admissions",
    "native debuglog requires actual installed process before capture",
    "native debuglog initializer falsy inputs preserve legitimate disabled noop and callback-once behavior",
    "native debuglog regex construction preserves exact wildcard comma escaping and case insensitive matching",
    "native debuglog original initialization method chain receives exact patterns receivers and coercion order",
    "native debuglog failed reinitialization clears implementation table before retaining the previous predicate",
    "native debuglog logger creation defers set coercion and enabled memoization preserves the captured uppercase set",
    "native debuglog callback receives original descriptor and assigned implementation before reentry",
    "native debuglog callback failure retains the assigned implementation and never repeats callback",
    "native debuglog enabled-first disabled path skips callback while ordinary first call invokes it",
    "native debuglog same set shares implementation while logger-local enabled values remain original",
    "native debuglog original shared noop enabled descriptor remains configurable across distinct sets",
    "native debuglog cached logger state follows original reinitialization behavior",
    "native debuglog actual formatter handles all dispatcher argument cardinalities and captures pid lazily",
